WEBVTT

00:08.675 --> 00:10.306
It's Reiner!

00:40.742 --> 00:41.940
Eren!

00:43.809 --> 00:45.991
Seems to me this fight's over.

00:46.075 --> 00:48.339
We've used the last of our strength.

00:49.475 --> 00:51.391
As for Reiner,

00:51.475 --> 00:54.573
I can't exactly kill him at this point.

00:57.075 --> 01:00.439
Okay, fine.
Then let's go back home.

01:03.342 --> 01:05.840
See you later, Reiner.

01:23.675 --> 01:25.791
Guard the ship from any hostiles below.

01:25.875 --> 01:28.859
If you've still got ammo,
then now's the time to use it.

01:28.943 --> 01:31.791
Looks like they're retreating.

01:31.875 --> 01:34.339
Does this mean we're safe?

01:36.009 --> 01:37.840
They're getting away.

01:41.742 --> 01:42.859
Gabi!

01:42.943 --> 01:47.391
Eren Jaeger!

01:47.475 --> 01:48.258
Gabi!

01:48.342 --> 01:52.006
You won't escape!
I'll shoot you down.

04:09.799 --> 04:12.130
Well, aren't you a filthy sight?

04:14.264 --> 04:18.596
It's like you fell in
a pile of shit, Eren.

04:19.799 --> 04:21.529
Captain Levi.

04:36.799 --> 04:38.729
This takes me back, Eren.

04:39.598 --> 04:43.515
You have a real kickable face,
you know that?

04:43.599 --> 04:47.915
Once you're tied up,
I'd like to have a longer chat.

04:47.999 --> 04:49.981
That's all right by me,

04:50.065 --> 04:53.181
but I explained everything
in the letters I wrote.

04:53.265 --> 04:55.696
Did you not understand them?

04:57.799 --> 05:00.715
Tch. I know that face.

05:00.799 --> 05:02.581
I used to see it on the rotten shits

05:02.665 --> 05:04.715
I met in the underground.

05:04.799 --> 05:07.996
Never thought I'd see it on you.

05:10.198 --> 05:11.915
Hey, cheer up.

05:11.999 --> 05:14.496
Everything went just like you wanted.

05:23.132 --> 05:26.696
Stop 'em!
Kill every last devil you can!

05:29.999 --> 05:30.915
Everyone get inside!

05:30.999 --> 05:33.049
If they had guns that
could take down an airship,

05:33.132 --> 05:35.581
they'd've brought them out by now.

05:35.665 --> 05:38.781
Jean! You go in, too.

05:38.865 --> 05:40.515
I'll keep an eye on things.

05:40.599 --> 05:41.981
Understood, Commander Lobov!

05:42.065 --> 05:43.581
We're counting on you, sir!

05:43.665 --> 05:47.181
I already told you.
I'm just a recruit now!

05:47.265 --> 05:50.781
Our people don't need
the Garrison anymore!

05:50.865 --> 05:52.448
And that goes double for

05:52.532 --> 05:54.863
the overpaid geezers in charge of it!

05:56.933 --> 05:57.849
Jean!

05:57.933 --> 05:58.915
Grab on!

05:58.999 --> 06:00.396
Thanks, you two.

06:02.733 --> 06:03.981
Who's left?

06:04.064 --> 06:06.181
We're still waiting on Lima Squad.

06:06.265 --> 06:08.114
But assuming that
all of them make it back,

06:08.198 --> 06:10.181
we've lost six soldiers.

06:10.265 --> 06:12.114
Right. Shit.

06:12.198 --> 06:16.781
That's nothing compared to
the damage we did to the enemy.

06:16.865 --> 06:18.181
Good work, soldiers!

06:18.265 --> 06:21.448
We just fought the New
Eldian Empire's first battle

06:21.532 --> 06:22.781
and it ended in victory!

06:22.865 --> 06:27.581
Yeah!

06:27.665 --> 06:29.581
That's right! Celebrate!

06:29.665 --> 06:33.062
That's how we'll pay tribute
to our six fallen heroes!

06:35.532 --> 06:37.114
Our first battle.

06:37.198 --> 06:40.781
I wonder how many more
we'll have to fight.

06:40.865 --> 06:43.062
How many more'll have to die?

06:47.599 --> 06:51.648
Honestly, I'm just glad that we made it.

06:51.732 --> 06:53.981
I know this isn't fair to the others,

06:54.064 --> 06:58.496
but you guys will always
be special... to me.

07:04.532 --> 07:06.448
That hurts, dumbass.

07:06.532 --> 07:08.981
Don't hug us while you've
got all that metal on.

07:09.064 --> 07:10.515
What'd you call me?

07:10.599 --> 07:12.581
You're the only dumbass I see here.

07:12.665 --> 07:14.981
Always playing with that
sorry excuse for a beard.

07:15.064 --> 07:15.648
Huh?

07:15.732 --> 07:17.181
Yeah, Conny's right!

07:17.265 --> 07:18.781
Even if you could grow a real beard,

07:18.865 --> 07:19.981
it's not like you could eat it.

07:20.064 --> 07:20.915
Huh?!

07:20.998 --> 07:23.048
Speaking of, are we eating soon?

07:23.132 --> 07:25.581
No. Not till
we reach the island.

07:25.665 --> 07:28.262
Seriously? Some leader you are.

07:30.865 --> 07:31.930
Gabi!

07:32.933 --> 07:35.396
Come on, Gabi, hold on a second!

07:48.665 --> 07:50.980
Stop. It's over.

07:51.064 --> 07:52.781
They're flying away, Gabi.

07:52.865 --> 07:55.448
There's no point in chasing them.

07:55.532 --> 07:56.930
Even you know that.

08:02.733 --> 08:04.715
They killed our friends.

08:04.799 --> 08:07.980
Zofia was right next to me, talking,

08:08.064 --> 08:11.581
and then she was crushed
by a flying rock.

08:11.665 --> 08:13.980
Udo tried to get it off her, but

08:14.064 --> 08:16.980
that just got him trampled by the crowd.

08:17.064 --> 08:19.581
They stepped on his head again and again

08:19.665 --> 08:21.781
till it cracked open.

08:21.865 --> 08:24.781
I ran into those gate guards we talk to,

08:24.865 --> 08:27.581
and they yelled at me

08:27.665 --> 08:30.581
'cause I was trying to
go back to the plaza.

08:30.665 --> 08:32.581
They said it was too dangerous.

08:32.665 --> 08:36.581
They tried to protect me
even though I'm Eldian.

08:36.665 --> 08:37.914
Now they're dead.

08:37.998 --> 08:40.929
I saw some woman
shoot them from a rooftop.

08:43.865 --> 08:47.181
Because I'm an Eldian who was
born in this internment zone,

08:47.265 --> 08:50.181
people spit at the sight
of me walking around.

08:50.265 --> 08:53.781
I have lots of memories
of getting treated like dirt,

08:53.865 --> 08:56.781
but they're the reason I try so hard.

08:56.865 --> 08:57.914
I'm fighting to show the world

08:57.998 --> 09:00.981
that the Eldians here are good people!

09:01.065 --> 09:03.515
I made it this far because
I believed that someday

09:03.599 --> 09:06.048
we could be proud of these armbands.

09:06.132 --> 09:09.515
I did everything I could
to make that happen,

09:09.599 --> 09:12.181
but now it's all been crushed.

09:12.265 --> 09:14.914
This internment zone is my home!

09:14.998 --> 09:18.914
I know it isn't perfect, but its
where the people I love live.

09:18.998 --> 09:22.630
So if somebody tramples it,
I'm not gonna forgive them.

09:25.532 --> 09:26.364
So why?

09:27.132 --> 09:30.448
Why would you tell me not to chase them?

09:30.532 --> 09:32.515
Mister Zeke was killed
right in front of us.

09:32.599 --> 09:35.181
Don't you wanna do something?

09:35.265 --> 09:38.981
Don't you wanna know why
all these people had to die?

09:39.065 --> 09:41.181
So why, Reiner?

09:41.265 --> 09:45.696
Tell me why my mom was eaten by a Titan.

09:48.265 --> 09:50.048
Their home was trampled, too.

09:50.132 --> 09:51.781
Huh?

09:51.864 --> 09:52.581
That's why.

09:52.665 --> 09:54.781
Our warriors attacked them years ago

09:54.864 --> 09:57.048
and killed lots of people.

09:57.132 --> 09:59.396
This is just revenge.

10:01.265 --> 10:05.781
So did you see that happen?

10:05.864 --> 10:09.581
Well no. I didn't.

10:09.665 --> 10:12.363
Neither did I, Falco.

10:23.665 --> 10:25.115
It doesn't matter.

10:25.199 --> 10:28.981
These island devils threaten
world peace, remember?

10:29.065 --> 10:30.715
We were taught all about them.

10:30.798 --> 10:31.981
They're savage and cruel

10:32.065 --> 10:33.181
and whatever we might've done to them,

10:33.265 --> 10:35.581
it wasn't half as bad
as what they deserved.

10:35.665 --> 10:37.763
Those devils aren't like us.

10:40.665 --> 10:44.114
Reiner. I'm the same as you.

10:44.198 --> 10:45.848
Same where I'm from.

10:45.932 --> 10:49.630
Inside the walls, we're all just people.

10:56.998 --> 10:59.581
Lima Squad's in.
That makes everyone.

10:59.665 --> 11:01.581
All troops accounted for!

11:01.665 --> 11:03.515
Tell the bridge we're good to ascend!

11:03.599 --> 11:04.663
Got it!

11:13.864 --> 11:15.430
It's just a kid!

11:23.733 --> 11:25.363
I shot him down.

11:34.798 --> 11:38.496
The line. It's still attached.

11:40.132 --> 11:41.596
Gabi!

11:43.665 --> 11:45.715
What do you think you're trying to do?

11:45.798 --> 11:48.896
It's this trigger.
If I pull it, then...

11:52.998 --> 11:55.780
Hold on. You wanna go up?

11:55.864 --> 11:57.530
Don't be crazy.

11:58.199 --> 12:00.515
I'll kill as many island devils as I can.

12:00.599 --> 12:01.515
Stop being an idiot,

12:01.599 --> 12:04.048
you're just gonna get yourself killed!

12:04.132 --> 12:06.781
Talk to my mom and dad for me.

12:06.865 --> 12:09.581
Talk to Reiner and the others, too.

12:09.665 --> 12:12.914
Tell them that I fought
my hardest, to the end.

12:12.998 --> 12:15.115
Even if I'm killed up there,

12:15.199 --> 12:18.914
all of you will carry
my spirit forward, right?

12:18.998 --> 12:21.581
Falco! Gabi!

12:21.665 --> 12:22.848
Are you two okay?

12:22.932 --> 12:25.115
What're you doing out here?

12:25.199 --> 12:26.781
It's Colt.

12:26.865 --> 12:30.781
This is it, Falco.
You take care.

12:30.865 --> 12:32.530
You're one of the good ones.

12:35.798 --> 12:37.914
Surpass Gabi to protect her.

12:37.998 --> 12:40.962
Spare her from the dark future we face.

12:46.065 --> 12:47.662
Falco!

12:49.998 --> 12:52.896
Falco?

12:54.199 --> 12:55.315
Why come with me?

12:55.399 --> 12:58.181
Because I'm the one who should
inherit the Armored Titan.

12:58.265 --> 12:59.581
You hear me?

12:59.664 --> 13:00.762
Huh?

13:07.732 --> 13:09.981
Hey, Jean, did you hear a sound just now?

13:10.065 --> 13:11.981
Hey! Quiet down for a second.

13:12.065 --> 13:14.914
Make some noise! To victory!

13:14.998 --> 13:16.181
Yeah!

13:16.265 --> 13:17.714
Guys.

13:17.798 --> 13:19.781
Hey. Lobov isn't back yet.

13:19.865 --> 13:22.729
Weird. He should've
come back a while ago.

13:42.199 --> 13:43.496
Sasha!

14:05.737 --> 14:08.853
Take that, you Marleyan bastards!

14:08.937 --> 14:11.386
Sasha! Sasha!

14:11.470 --> 14:13.720
Hey. Stay with me.

14:13.804 --> 14:15.234
Hey!

14:16.737 --> 14:20.367
Why are you so loud...?

14:23.137 --> 14:27.853
Are we eating soon or what?

14:27.937 --> 14:30.653
She's bleeding! Find us
some bandages! Hurry!

14:30.737 --> 14:31.386
Right!

14:31.470 --> 14:34.035
Come on. Just hang in there.

14:35.470 --> 14:37.401
Meat...

14:52.270 --> 14:54.120
Jean. Lobov's dead.

14:54.203 --> 14:57.301
They shot him and climbed
aboard using his ODM gear.

14:58.804 --> 15:02.068
I'll toss 'em
outside. All right?

15:08.270 --> 15:11.053
Do you really think
tossing kids out of an airship

15:11.136 --> 15:14.301
is gonna help us stop all this killing?

15:25.604 --> 15:28.252
What happened to Braun and Grice?

15:28.336 --> 15:29.252
They ran off.

15:29.336 --> 15:31.320
Neither one of them said
where they were going.

15:31.404 --> 15:33.234
I haven't seen 'em since.

15:38.404 --> 15:40.035
Hey, Pieck.

15:42.404 --> 15:46.568
Commander. I remember now.

15:47.804 --> 15:50.853
I know that Marleyan soldier.

15:50.937 --> 15:55.653
The one who led us away from
the plaza and into a trap.

15:55.737 --> 15:59.186
I know exactly where I saw them last.

15:59.270 --> 16:03.186
It was about three years ago
during an inspection

16:03.270 --> 16:07.053
of the first survey fleet
to go to Paradis,

16:07.136 --> 16:09.720
after Reiner came back from his mission.

16:09.804 --> 16:13.653
Wait, the scout ships that disappeared?

16:13.737 --> 16:17.252
Yeah. I'm sure of it.

16:17.336 --> 16:22.120
That beard looked so unnatural on them.

16:22.204 --> 16:25.734
Hey. How long are you gonna
make me look at that thing?

16:26.737 --> 16:29.735
What's your problem?
Everyone else likes it.

16:33.604 --> 16:36.386
Are they still celebrating our "victory"?

16:36.470 --> 16:38.186
Let go of me!

16:38.270 --> 16:41.453
You haven't defeated us yet,
you filthy island devils!

16:41.537 --> 16:43.586
You might've killed Zeke,
but not his spirit!

16:43.670 --> 16:46.453
We'll carry his will forward!

16:46.537 --> 16:48.301
Gabi. Stop!

16:49.270 --> 16:51.334
What do we do with 'em, Jean?

16:53.537 --> 16:55.252
Us true Eldians are gonna haunt you

16:55.336 --> 16:57.186
till you're all rotting in the ground.

16:57.270 --> 17:01.386
You tell that to the bastard
who planned this once I'm dead!

17:01.470 --> 17:03.467
Think I'll just take you to him.

17:04.737 --> 17:06.653
Then you can tell him yourself.

17:06.737 --> 17:08.734
Sound good to you?

17:18.404 --> 17:21.787
How were you able to recognize them?

17:21.871 --> 17:24.453
Well. The soldier
happened to be

17:24.537 --> 17:27.601
someone I had a personal interest in.

17:28.671 --> 17:33.520
Because she's a devout
follower of Zeke Jaeger.

17:33.604 --> 17:39.252
Gabi, Falco?
How did you get here?

17:39.336 --> 17:41.186
What about you?

17:41.270 --> 17:42.320
We thought that you were dead.

17:42.404 --> 17:43.453
They took you alive?

17:43.537 --> 17:46.635
But how is that possible?
Why would you let them?

17:50.404 --> 17:52.320
Who the hell are these kids?

17:52.404 --> 17:54.453
They somehow killed Lobov,

17:54.537 --> 17:56.853
and then used his gear to climb aboard.

17:56.937 --> 17:59.601
This one shot Sasha
before we could catch her.

18:01.937 --> 18:04.734
I don't think she's gonna make it.

18:11.136 --> 18:13.853
I'll leave the rest to you, Onyankopon.

18:13.936 --> 18:15.401
I'm on it, Hange!

18:17.936 --> 18:18.920
Well, Zeke.

18:19.003 --> 18:22.252
It seems everything's
played out just like you wanted.

18:22.336 --> 18:23.568
Wouldn't you say?

18:27.737 --> 18:30.453
I did make a few miscalculations,

18:30.537 --> 18:33.034
but aside from that, I would.

18:34.070 --> 18:35.853
Zeke?

18:35.936 --> 18:39.520
Huh? Wait, who are these kids?

18:39.604 --> 18:41.520
Miscalculations.

18:41.604 --> 18:42.653
Damn it, Yelena!

18:42.737 --> 18:44.787
Why didn't you lock down
the Cart Titan and Jaw Titan

18:44.871 --> 18:46.453
like you said you would?

18:46.537 --> 18:49.052
We lost good people because of you!

18:49.136 --> 18:50.453
I'm sorry.

18:50.537 --> 18:54.052
I can assure you that
they both fell into the pit,

18:54.136 --> 18:56.453
but it's still my fault.

18:56.537 --> 18:59.386
Guess that's why you threw
more rocks at us than planned.

18:59.470 --> 19:02.653
You had to put on a show
for your comrades, didn't ya?

19:02.737 --> 19:06.653
Quite the performance,
coming from a mangy furball.

19:06.737 --> 19:09.052
Yeah. Well done.

19:09.136 --> 19:12.120
Aw. Please don't glare, Levi.

19:12.204 --> 19:15.253
You don't wanna make me
piss my pants, do you?

19:15.337 --> 19:18.186
And you gave quite
the performance, yourself.

19:18.270 --> 19:21.535
Considering how bad you wish
you could actually kill me.

19:23.671 --> 19:26.252
I'm the kind of person
who saves the best bite

19:26.336 --> 19:28.386
for the end of my meal.

19:28.470 --> 19:31.468
I can really savor the taste that way.

19:33.070 --> 19:35.252
We killed Marley's brass

19:35.336 --> 19:38.587
and took out their
primary fleet and port.

19:38.671 --> 19:41.453
That oughtta buy us some time.

19:41.537 --> 19:43.587
Before the whole world
comes crashing down on us

19:43.671 --> 19:46.453
with a coordinated attack, you mean.

19:46.537 --> 19:49.320
Every single time you
get yourself caught,

19:49.404 --> 19:52.052
we give up lives to get you back.

19:52.136 --> 19:55.120
No matter how high the cost, we pay it.

19:55.204 --> 19:58.186
You noticed that trend
and used it against us.

19:58.270 --> 20:01.186
Held yourself hostage to force our hand.

20:01.270 --> 20:05.186
We had no choice except
to do what you wanted.

20:05.270 --> 20:07.253
You put your trust in us,

20:07.337 --> 20:10.434
and we've lost our trust in you, Eren.

20:11.537 --> 20:13.386
You gain from this, too.

20:13.470 --> 20:15.186
You now possess the Founding Titan

20:15.270 --> 20:17.520
as well as a Titan with royal blood.

20:17.604 --> 20:22.453
All your comrade's sacrifices
are about to bear fruit at last.

20:22.537 --> 20:24.501
Eldia will be free.

20:35.671 --> 20:37.587
It's Sasha.

20:37.671 --> 20:39.501
She just died.

20:59.604 --> 21:01.720
Conny.

21:01.803 --> 21:07.986
Did Sasha... leave you...
any last words?

21:08.070 --> 21:10.933
She asked... for some meat.

21:21.671 --> 21:23.453
Can you guys keep a secret,

21:23.537 --> 21:27.168
'cause I totally just helped
myself to the Officer's Pantry.

21:29.936 --> 21:31.852
But hey. It'll be all right.

21:31.936 --> 21:33.852
I mean once we've taken our land back,

21:33.936 --> 21:36.967
we'll have all the room
we need for livestock!

21:49.803 --> 21:51.520
Eren.

21:51.604 --> 21:54.852
Sasha only died because you
dragged the Scouts into this.

21:54.936 --> 21:56.468
You know that?

23:41.004 --> 23:44.453
Was there some other
hidden path they could've taken?

23:44.536 --> 23:47.586
The immutable past renders
that question irrelevant.

23:47.670 --> 23:49.187
They have no choice

23:49.271 --> 23:52.053
but to continue down
the path before them.

23:52.137 --> 23:54.768
Next episode:
"Brave Volunteers."
